linux-sunfish (7.1.0-sm7150-20261026.3+git473d9fb95156) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Align OBS with release/sunfish-0.26.1024.1, including all five lens and
    charger fixes missing from the previous OBS branch.
  * Require GCC 14 for both target and host tools and reject another compiler
    major before compiling. Keep the kernel release at 7.1.0-sm7150.
  * Preserve the GCC 14 selection when rebuilding installed header helpers
    for the target architecture during cross-packaging, and declare the
    target libc development headers needed by those helper programs.
  * Use a release-specific package version and include source, compiler and
    artifact provenance in each binary package.

